			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 60080101,
					"content": "又过去了几天，这里怎么样了呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080102,
					"content": "变化似乎没有想象中那么大。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080103,
					"content": "看来逐渐稳定下来了呢，菈乌玛真有本事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080104,
					"content": "菈乌玛，我们来啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080105,
					"content": "这几天怎么样？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080106,
					"content": "收尾工作比我想象中复杂很多，打理积攒下来的问题并不是个容易的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080107,
					"content": "按照现在的进度，估计还需要几周的时间。所幸，留下的人也像是扫除了心中的迷惘，变得更加积极了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080108,
					"content": "仿佛此时此刻，他们才真正邂逅了属于自己的信仰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080109,
					"content": "这都是你的功劳啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080110,
					"content": "不要这么说，我本应该更早去做这件事的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080111,
					"content": "最近我都在调养自己的身体，既然「月髓」现在由你保管，我应该能试着帮你探究过去的事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080112,
					"content": "谢谢你，还记得这件事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080113,
					"content": "说起来，关于那个诡影，你听说过什么新消息吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080114,
					"content": "嗯，我尝试问过一些人，但没有什么情报。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080115,
					"content": "你们那边如何？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080116,
					"content": "进展不多，但现在是这样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080117,
					"content": "大概明白了…你们的工作也不比任何人轻松。请多照顾好自己的身体。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080118,
					"content": "#那么，{NICKNAME}，请到这边来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080119,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080120,
					"content": "你看到什么了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080121,
					"content": "（这里是…挪德卡莱？我好像对这风景有印象…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080122,
					"content": "（天空中那是…一颗流星？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080123,
					"content": "（…！不对！那是我们的飞船！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080124,
					"content": "结、结束了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080125,
					"content": "这似乎是很久以前发生的事，我感受到的记忆涌动十分紊乱，凭我的力量只能看到这么多信息了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080126,
					"content": "（至少知道了我们的飞船迫降在挪德卡莱的位置…好像是在星砂滩附近。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080127,
					"content": "#（也和{M#荧}{F#哥哥}告诉我的事实对得上…但，果然还想知道更多…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080128,
					"content": "！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "努昂诺塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080129,
					"content": "欸，你突然怎么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080130,
					"content": "花的颜色变了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080131,
					"content": "（这种花是「少女」力量的写照。难道说她的身体又…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080132
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080132,
					"content": "（我记得她好像说过，想用「月髓」来恢复一些力量…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080133,
					"content": "派蒙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080134,
					"content": "嗯，我懂！我们还是快去见她吧，看看有没有什么能帮到她的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080135,
					"content": "那就拜托你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080136,
					"content": "对了，这个是你之前拜托「秘闻馆」准备的药。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080137,
					"content": "谢谢你们专程送过来，帮大忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080138,
					"content": "另外…我有一个推测。关于你的飞船，或许「库塔{RUBY#[S]月之少女}尔」能为你展现更多片段。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080139,
					"content": "对哦！她可是「月神」呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080140,
					"content": "但首先还是确保她没什么大碍吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080141,
					"content": "那我们待会儿见！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
